# coverage.py's data file. `coverage/` above catches the HTML report directory
# and not this, which is a SQLite database storing the ABSOLUTE path of every
# file it measured. One was sitting untracked in packages/story-engine holding
# this machine's home directory; on a public repo that is one careless `git add`
# away from being published.
.coverage
.coverage.*

